The first token in a document gets a large positive value.  Initial runs of
identical tokens keep this pulse.  Two observed onset patterns, '12' and
'Title:', also give a large value on their second token.  Later tokens get
only a small, gradually decreasing baseline.  No token-ID lookup is used.
