- prepositions ("to", "in", "with", "of", "on", ...) are the most negative, about -12;
- other function words (articles, auxiliaries, conjunctions, pronouns), about -8;
- capitalised or ordinary words, about -6.5 to -7;
- commas, about -7; other punctuation and symbols, about -5;
- digits, about -4;
